Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:01.60,D,,0,0,0,,눈 뜨자마자
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.38,D,,0,0,0,,창밖이 {\c&H0080FF&}바다{\c&HFFFFFF&}로
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.23,D,,0,0,0,,꽉 차요
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:04.08,D,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0080FF&}포항{\c&HFFFFFF&} 바닷가
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:05.13,D,,0,0,0,,앞 {\c&H0080FF&}풀빌라{\c&HFFFFFF&}인데
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:06.31,D,,0,0,0,,객실마다 {\c&H0080FF&}통창{\c&HFFFFFF&}이
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:06.63,D,,0,0,0,,벽 한
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:07.46,D,,0,0,0,,면이에요
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:07.95,D,,0,0,0,,해 뜨는
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:08.81,D,,0,0,0,,시간엔 거실에
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:09.67,D,,0,0,0,,앉아서 동해
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:10.46,D,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0080FF&}일출{\c&HFFFFFF&} 보고
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.19,D,,0,0,0,,창가 따라
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:11.93,D,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0080FF&}수영장{\c&HFFFFFF&}이 있는
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.16,D,,0,0,0,,객실도 있어요
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.09,D,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0080FF&}침대{\c&HFFFFFF&}에 누워도
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:15.38,D,,0,0,0,,바다가 한가득이고
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:16.40,D,,0,0,0,,해변까지 걸어서
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:17.31,D,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0080FF&}5분{\c&HFFFFFF&}이라
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:18.06,D,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0080FF&}알람 없이{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:18.60,D,,0,0,0,,바다 보고
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.38,D,,0,0,0,,일어나는 곳이에요
